                            {
                                "target_word": "Creek",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3f8e5652-fab5-36e8-b8e5-b70816c4c9a6",
                                        "entry_id": "e67b2f32-57a7-3b62-87f8-1d6a22abee48",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or pertaining to the Creek tribe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebd01b7a-7402-4de6-9930-e5c49c831dc0",
                                                "sense_id": "3f8e5652-fab5-36e8-b8e5-b70816c4c9a6",
                                                "text": "The chieftain was well versed in Creek history."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Creek",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fe94348d-59dc-37aa-acd3-07d601e72bda",
                                        "entry_id": "b05a5268-ed2a-39f2-9da6-06d9cb03faae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The ship of characters Craig Tucker and Tweek Tweak from the South Park series."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "050c2dca-9e7b-42ac-83f1-20a119a056e8",
                                                "sense_id": "fe94348d-59dc-37aa-acd3-07d601e72bda",
                                                "text": "For at least a decade, people on the internet have been drawing fan art of the love between this two characters (a ship known as \"Creek\"). A cursory search of DeviantArt shows Creek art dating back to 2005. And when Trey Parker and Matt Stone decided it was finally time to acknowledge Creek and their surprisingly robust online fandom, they went straight to the source, soliciting real drawings from users online."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d56877b1-9dce-41db-ac4c-14e0f319c1a8",
                                                "sense_id": "fe94348d-59dc-37aa-acd3-07d601e72bda",
                                                "text": "The episode’s humor and heart speak to viewers bemused at the concept of yaoi and devoted “Creek” shippers alike, but it isn’t the child characters learning something by the show’s conclusion. Instead, it’s a father who learns a lesson about being a better parent to his son."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11885e07-c961-41e9-9730-a6bda14140e5",
                                                "sense_id": "fe94348d-59dc-37aa-acd3-07d601e72bda",
                                                "text": "This [“Tweek vs. Craig”] is a regular season 3 outing that aired in June 1999, and I picked it not merely because I'm a hardcore Creek shipper."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9493dd51-1643-40a9-88cc-9f370bfa71e9",
                        "source_entry_id": "c3b4fd15-396c-3cb3-9ad9-cf933c4e3653",
                        "source_sense_id": "4097fed6-cfef-32a8-8f48-15177de69ab3",
                        "source_sense_description": "nur Plural: ein Indianervolk, ein Indianerstamm, der im Südosten der USA ansässig ist",
